{"3601680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slain 2: The Beast Within", "steam_appid": 3601680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ongoing saga of <strong>sentient sword</strong> <strong>Bathoryn</strong> and his many wielders, the battle rages on against the demonic forces of <strong>Lord Vroll</strong>, spanning the vast reaches of the galaxy. <br> <br>The night is dark, and the hunt is endless. <strong>Prince Akran, the last of the Wolf Knights</strong>, wields <strong>Bathoryn</strong> and the fury of the full moon to reclaim a dying land. <br> <br><strong>Will he rise, or will darkness claim all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/759ed6c4f8fd4b929836d636a6cb2983.avif?t=1786464562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras_big/759ed6c4f8fd4b929836d636a6cb2983.avif?t=1786464562 width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/d2e2ca3df86f67c790401d5d06966d6f.poster.avif?t=1786464562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/d2e2ca3df86f67c790401d5d06966d6f.webm?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/d2e2ca3df86f67c790401d5d06966d6f.mp4?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash brutal <strong>melee strikes and precision-based attacks</strong>, countering foes in a deadly ballet of steel and fury. The sentient blade Bathoryn grants elemental powers, letting you cleave through enemies with <strong>fire, ice, and raw devastation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/8f7fcb1cf5e48905bed066fdc74d8cb4.avif?t=1786464562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras_big/8f7fcb1cf5e48905bed066fdc74d8cb4.avif?t=1786464562 width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/091235a36959e3e8916621fd006008fb.poster.avif?t=1786464562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/091235a36959e3e8916621fd006008fb.webm?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/091235a36959e3e8916621fd006008fb.mp4?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the full moon, the Beast within emerges. Embrace the monstrous <strong>power of the Wolf Knights </strong>and transform into a feral werewolf, unleashing a <strong>torrent of claws, teeth, and beastly power that obliterates all in your path.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/9c7ff491fb43dce04793f7c61b7bca90.avif?t=1786464562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras_big/9c7ff491fb43dce04793f7c61b7bca90.avif?t=1786464562 width=800 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/05edd0161705b86e3fbe8abfc0f3ed46.poster.avif?t=1786464562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/05edd0161705b86e3fbe8abfc0f3ed46.webm?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/05edd0161705b86e3fbe8abfc0f3ed46.mp4?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Akran’s path is paved with peril. Venture through three brutal, hand-crafted quests - each featuring their own sinister landscapes, twisted lore, and nightmarish foes. Sail ghostly seas, storm haunted castles, and descend into the abyss to claim the sacred relics: <strong>The Eye, The Heart, and The Dagger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/fb54617615e7a0d5ebdd05ff4dd1a3e6.avif?t=1786464562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras_big/fb54617615e7a0d5ebdd05ff4dd1a3e6.avif?t=1786464562 width=800 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/961a7c456f65601841d0e916597bfd95.poster.avif?t=1786464562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/961a7c456f65601841d0e916597bfd95.webm?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/961a7c456f65601841d0e916597bfd95.mp4?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time for hesitation is over. Akran’s fate - and the fate of the kingdom - <strong>rests in your hands. The hunt begins now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/05d7863519fb1e8d408de9748395f46f.poster.avif?t=1786464562\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/05d7863519fb1e8d408de9748395f46f.webm?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/05d7863519fb1e8d408de9748395f46f.mp4?t=1786464562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ongoing saga of <strong>sentient sword</strong> <strong>Bathoryn</strong> and his many wielders, the battle rages on against the demonic forces of <strong>Lord Vroll</strong>, spanning the vast reaches of the galaxy. <br> <br>The night is dark, and the hunt is endless. <strong>Prince Akran, the last of the Wolf Knights</strong>, wields <strong>Bathoryn</strong> and the fury of the full moon to reclaim a dying land. <br> <br><strong>Will he rise, or will darkness claim all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras/759ed6c4f8fd4b929836d636a6cb2983.avif?t=1786464562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601680/extras_big/759ed6c4f8fd4b929836d636a6cb2983.avif?t=1786464562 width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as